    "name": "Lone Bird in the Tree",
    "steam_appid": 3158450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cMy best friend left me nothing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>_ but he/she taught me a lot.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cStory\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character visits the country town of Fu\u00dfdorf in search of the scenery his/her best friend wanted to show him/her before his/her death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, he/she meets \u201cChris\u201d who resembles his/her best friend, and his/her heart is shaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Chris has secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is covered up with distorted good intentions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an unforgettable 13 days that will pierce the heart of the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cFeatures of this game\uff1e</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique gender selection system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four characters have both male and female genders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the four characters, including the main character, can choose their gender, while the other two are determined by the main character's choice of gender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main storyline does not change significantly depending on the combination of genders chosen, but the content of conversations and some relationships between the characters will change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Main character R\uff08 Rudolf / Regina ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/31e9dcfe2a618a759e1f969ed08d214c.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Resident C ( Chris / Chris )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/cac6f3ebf35b45b6f5612866363ecd4c.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Resident H ( Hugo / Helene ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/a3c3dd77482e960a26360c656ca1afb4.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Best friend J ( Johannes / Johanna ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/29416652a2d0e7dcf015e191198fcbfc.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Truth Revealed by Repeating &quot;Main Story&quot; and &quot;Past Story&quot; </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a \u201cMain Story\u201d and a \u201cPast Story\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cMain Story\u201d, the main character spends 13 days with the residents in the country town of Fu\u00dfdorf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cPast Story\u201d  begins by reading a diary about the days with his/her best friend who died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is exploration and choice in the \u201cMain Story\u201d, but not in the \u201cPast Story\u201d. Days gone by consists only of conversational events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc \u201cMain Story\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/59af6f480dd0762a5646705a12df2453.avif?t=1745320237\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc \u201cPast Story\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/d567daa73673f19d93df26ee514d1e0f.avif?t=1745320237\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By reading both the \u201cMain Story\u201d and the \u201cPast Story,\u201d players will discover the truth behind the death of his/her best friend and the secrets of the residents who have been keeping secrets from them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The ending of the story changes depending on the level of trust</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters have a \u201ctrust level\u201d that is changed by the choices they make in the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This trust level is determined by the cumulative total of the values set in the choices, and the ending of the story changes according to this value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trust level may increase, decrease, or remain the same regardless of which of the two options you choose. Trust your instincts and make your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_Even if the main character ends up in any way, he/she will never see his/her best friend again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cMy best friend left me nothing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>_ but he/she taught me a lot.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cStory\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character visits the country town of Fu\u00dfdorf in search of the scenery his/her best friend wanted to show him/her before his/her death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, he/she meets \u201cChris\u201d who resembles his/her best friend, and his/her heart is shaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Chris has secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is covered up with distorted good intentions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an unforgettable 13 days that will pierce the heart of the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cFeatures of this game\uff1e</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique gender selection system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four characters have both male and female genders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the four characters, including the main character, can choose their gender, while the other two are determined by the main character's choice of gender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main storyline does not change significantly depending on the combination of genders chosen, but the content of conversations and some relationships between the characters will change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Main character R\uff08 Rudolf / Regina ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/31e9dcfe2a618a759e1f969ed08d214c.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Resident C ( Chris / Chris )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/cac6f3ebf35b45b6f5612866363ecd4c.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Resident H ( Hugo / Helene ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/a3c3dd77482e960a26360c656ca1afb4.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc Best friend J ( Johannes / Johanna ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/29416652a2d0e7dcf015e191198fcbfc.avif?t=1745320237\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Truth Revealed by Repeating &quot;Main Story&quot; and &quot;Past Story&quot; </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a \u201cMain Story\u201d and a \u201cPast Story\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cMain Story\u201d, the main character spends 13 days with the residents in the country town of Fu\u00dfdorf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cPast Story\u201d  begins by reading a diary about the days with his/her best friend who died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is exploration and choice in the \u201cMain Story\u201d, but not in the \u201cPast Story\u201d. Days gone by consists only of conversational events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc \u201cMain Story\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/59af6f480dd0762a5646705a12df2453.avif?t=1745320237\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc \u201cPast Story\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158450/extras/d567daa73673f19d93df26ee514d1e0f.avif?t=1745320237\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By reading both the \u201cMain Story\u201d and the \u201cPast Story,\u201d players will discover the truth behind the death of his/her best friend and the secrets of the residents who have been keeping secrets from them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The ending of the story changes depending on the level of trust</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters have a \u201ctrust level\u201d that is changed by the choices they make in the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This trust level is determined by the cumulative total of the values set in the choices, and the ending of the story changes according to this value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trust level may increase, decrease, or remain the same regardless of which of the two options you choose. Trust your instincts and make your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_Even if the main character ends up in any way, he/she will never see his/her best friend again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cLone Bird in the Tree\u201d is an ADV with male and female versions of each of the four characters. The story alternates between the \u201cfuture\u201d of the main character, who is deeply traumatized by the grief of his/her best friend, and the \u201cstory leading up to the loss of his/her best friend\u201d.",
